su name example meta be map def
su name required ob ve text "PYA_MIND_TOOL" "OLLAMA_HOST" ya
prah

su name coding tools be map def
su name command be command ob text input to name text out can
su name repair be repair ob text input to name map outcome can
prah

ob text "mkdir -p examples/out && cat <<'JS' > examples/out/gptoss-repair-target.js
console.log(41);
JS" be command do

exists su name helper system ob text "You are a coding assistant. Use only these tools: command(ob text input -> to name text out), repair(ob text input -> to name map outcome). For file edits use repair. For execution use command. Do not call read/write/list tools." ya
exists su name helper be mind as name "gpt-oss:latest" fromtext name helper system ya

ob text quoted.text.Use tools in this order:
1) Call repair with this exact patch text:
--- a/examples/out/gptoss-repair-target.js
+++ b/examples/out/gptoss-repair-target.js
@@ -1,1 +1,1 @@
-console.log(41);
+console.log(42);
2) Call command with ob text set to: node examples/out/gptoss-repair-target.js
Reply with only the final stdout text..text.quoted for name helper to name text output with name coding tools be write do
ob name output be write do
